         "name": "triv",
         "heightMax": 130,
         "heightMin": 130,
         "data": {
          "trivium": "The shot surveying Project Mayhem's destructive equipment lying in underground parking lots was a three-dimensional composition of over 100 photographs of Los Angeles and Century City by special effects photographer Michael Douglas Middleton."
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "widget",
         "class": "IMTitlePageQuotesWidget",
         "name": "quot",
         "heightMax": 130,
         "heightMin": 130,
         "data": {
          "quote": {
           "lines": [
            {
             "stage": "first lines"
            },
            {
             "stage": "Tyler points a gun into the Narrator's mouth"
            },
            {
             "stage": "voiceover",
             "quote": "People are always asking me if I know Tyler Durden. ",
             "chars": [
              {
               "nconst": "nm0001570",
               "char": "Narrator"
              }
             ]
            },
            {
             "quote": "Three minutes. This is it - ground zero. Would you like to say a few words to mark the occasion? ",
             "chars": [
              {
               "nconst": "nm0000093",
               "char": "Tyler Durden"
              }
             ]
            },
            {
             "quote": "...i... ann... iinn... ff... nnyin... ",
             "chars": [
              {
               "nconst": "nm0001570",
               "char": "Narrator"
              }
             ]
            },
            {
             "stage": "voiceover",
             "quote": "With a gun barrel between your teeth, you speak only in vowels. ",
             "chars": [
              {
               "nconst": "nm0001570",
               "char": "Narrator"
              }
             ]
            },
            {
             "stage": "Tyler removes the gun from the Narrator's mouth"
            },
            {
             "quote": "I can't think of anything. ",
             "chars": [
              {
               "nconst": "nm0001570",
               "char": "Narrator"
              }
             ]
            },
            {
             "stage": "voiceover",
             "quote": "For a second I totally forgot about Tyler's whole controlled demolition thing and I wonder how clean that gun is.",
             "chars": [
              {
               "nconst": "nm0001570",
               "char": "Narrator"
              }
             ]
            }
           ],
           "qconst": "qt0479091"
          }
         }
